{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31322","headline":"喷玉泉冥会诗八首 四丈夫同赋 三 · 李玖","name":"喷玉泉冥会诗八首 四丈夫同赋 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落花寂寂草绵绵，云影山光尽宛然。\n坏室基摧新石鼠，瀦宫水引故山泉。\n青云自致惭天爵，白首同[归]感昔贤。\n惆怅林间中夜月，孤光曾照读书筵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李玖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31322.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31322","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}